      en: ["Length: 673 km (418 mi)", "Drainage basin: 55,000 km²", "Source: Appalachian Mountains, Maine", "Mouth: Bay of Fundy", "Tidal range at estuary: up to 8 m", "Basin population: approximately 1.5 million"],
